 경우가 매 신청 시마다 발생하고 있습니다</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #77b02b\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #77b02b\">2. 근로지 추가 되었습니다. : 대학근로-갤러리</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #77b02b\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #77b02b\">3. 근로배정시간이 변경되었습니다. : 그린에너지산업화지원센터 3시간→4시간</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #77b02b\">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ffffff; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #77b02b\">4. 교내, 대학근로(육체) 근로장학금이 8,350원으로 확정되었습니다.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">&lt;2018학년도 2학기 방학중 부서별 근로장학생 모집 알림&gt;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>★ 신청기간 : 12.10.(월) </strong><strong>10:00 </strong><strong>~12.12.(수) 18:00 까지</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"COLOR: #0900ff\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span>★ </span>2018-2학기 재학생만 신청가능합니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>&nbsp; - 방학 중 </strong></span></span>재학생으로 학적 유지</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span>★ 근로시간, 근무부서(희망근무장소)는 예산 사정 등에 의해서 변경될 수 있습니다.</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span>★ 계획이 변경/추가되어 추가 모집이 필요한 경우 추가 모집 공고를 할 수 있습니다.</span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; 